src/access/adminOrSelf.ts:22:}
src/access/adminOrSelf.ts:24:/**
src/access/adminOrSelf.ts:25: * Field-level read access helper (`R-11`): allows `admin` to read any user's
src/access/adminOrSelf.ts:26: * field, and allows non-admin staff (`editor`) to read the field ONLY on their
